Description: Provides tools for the quantitative analysis of axon integrity
    in phase-contrast microscopy images. 'AiES' (Axon integrity Evaluation
    System) implements image pre-processing, adaptive thresholding, feature
    extraction, and support vector machine-based classification to compute
    indices such as the Axon Integrity Index (AII) and Degeneration Index
    (DI). Two built-in models are provided, and classifiers can be re-trained
    on user data. The package is designed for reproducible and automated
    analysis in neuroscience research.
